  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Disaster Risk Reduction and Surge Support (DRRS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RVO provides water-related experts through its Dutch Disaster Risk Reduction &amp; Surge Support (DRRS) programme. DRRS aims to prevent and reduce the impact of water and climate-related disasters worldwide and increase the resilience of affected areas and populations.The DRRS programme operates in all disaster management cycle phases: mitigation, preparedness, response and recovery. Foreign governments and humanitarian actors can request support. Every intervention is tailor-made. DRRS can assemble a team with relevant stakeholders and (local) experts based on the challenge and expertise needed.</narrative>
  </description>
